{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05842","headline":"戏赠张五弟諲三首 三 · 王维","name":"戏赠张五弟諲三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"设罝守毚兔，垂钓伺游鳞。\n此是安口腹，非关慕隐沦。\n吾生好清净，蔬食去情尘。\n今子方豪荡，思爲鼎食人。\n我家南山下，动息自遗身。\n入鸟不相乱，见兽皆相亲。\n云霞成伴侣，虚白侍衣巾。\n何事须夫子，邀予谷口真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}